sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as Event loop
  participant A as call_llm(prompt_1)
  participant B as call_llm(prompt_2)
  participant N as Network

  L->>A: resume
  A->>N: request
  Note over A: hits await —<br/>yields control
  A-->>L: suspended
  L->>B: resume
  B->>N: request
  B-->>L: suspended
  Note over L: loop is idle, not blocked.<br/>Both requests are in flight.
  N-->>L: response for prompt_2
  L->>B: resume with result
  B-->>L: done
  N-->>L: response for prompt_1
  L->>A: resume with result
  A-->>L: done
